                                "sense_id": "acede842-2d9c-3c96-ac02-299370174f25",
                                "text": "1613, John Webster, “A Monumental Column, A Funeral Elegy” in Three Elegies on the most lamented Death of Prince Henrie, London: William Welbie,\nMy impresa to your lordship; a swan\nFlying to a laurel for shelter."
